{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716160/extras/70084c6498f2fb2834db39b56202b738.avif?t=1758625714\" width=550 height=110 /></span><br><strong>Photo Puzzles HD</strong> is a relaxing <strong>jigsaw-style puzzle game</strong> where you complete beautiful HD photos by swapping, rotating, and arranging tiles. It\u2019s a <strong>good old puzzle experience</strong> with modern design, soothing music, and thousands of images to enjoy. Perfect for anyone who loves classic puzzles and cozy, stress-free gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Three Classic Puzzle Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tile Swap</strong> \u2013 Swap square tiles into their correct positions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tile Rotation</strong> \u2013 Rotate pieces until the picture is restored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split Tiles</strong> \u2013 Swap rectangular tiles to complete challenging photos.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f Relax and Unwind</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with <strong>over 3000 stunning HD photos</strong> across 126 categories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No DLC required</strong> \u2013 everything is unlocked from the start.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Puzzle Creator</strong> \u2013 turn your own photos into puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calming music and a peaceful atmosphere for a cozy, stress-free experience.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 difficulty levels</strong> from easy 6x4 grids to expert 21x14 challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New <strong>relaxing puzzles every two days</strong> to keep your brain active.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun sound effects, modern design, and smooth gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable for both kids and adults.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, relaxing to play, yet challenging to master.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9\ud83c\udf38 <strong>Photo Puzzles HD \u2013 a relaxing, good old jigsaw puzzle game with thousands of HD photos. Perfect for puzzle lovers who enjoy calming, classic, and cozy gameplay.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1716160?t=1758625714","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1716160?t=1758625714","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716160/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758625714","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716160/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758625714","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2344760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716160/extras/70084c6498f2fb2834db39b56202b738.avif?t=1758625714\" width=550 height=110 /></span><br><strong>Photo Puzzles HD</strong> is a relaxing <strong>jigsaw-style puzzle game</strong> where you complete beautiful HD photos by swapping, rotating, and arranging tiles. It\u2019s a <strong>good old puzzle experience</strong> with modern design, soothing music, and thousands of images to enjoy. Perfect for anyone who loves classic puzzles and cozy, stress-free gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Three Classic Puzzle Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tile Swap</strong> \u2013 Swap square tiles into their correct positions.</